    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Regardless of how Picture in Picture stops, the controller calls the delegate’s [`pictureInPictureControllerWillStopPictureInPicture(_:)`](avpictureinpicturecontrollerdelegate/pictureinpicturecontrollerwillstoppictureinpicture(_:).md) method.",
      "ko": "Picture in Picture가 어떤 방식으로 중지되더라도 컨트롤러는 대리자의 [`pictureInPictureControllerWillStopPictureInPicture(_:)`](avpictureinpicturecontrollerdelegate/pictureinpicturecontrollerwillstoppictureinpicture(_:).md) 메서드를 호출합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "49637b8e6b67ebc64993d83cc22a42491c8af4ea0727f6c733013b6374663734",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "When the PiP animation completes, the controller finalizes the session by calling the delegate’s [`pictureInPictureControllerDidStopPictureInPicture(_:)`](avpictureinpicturecontrollerdelegate/pictureinpicturecontrollerdidstoppictureinpicture(_:).md) method.",
      "ko": "PiP 애니메이션이 완료되면 컨트롤러는 세션을 마무리하기 위해 대리자의 [`pictureInPictureControllerDidStopPictureInPicture(_:)`](avpictureinpicturecontrollerdelegate/pictureinpicturecontrollerdidstoppictureinpicture(_:).md) 메서드를 호출합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2d865435725ae30a867467acc04c9657683bec347df5b51ab3aa35ff8d4efa3f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
